  "sentences": [
   "The bill would fix mistakes in Acts caused by drafting and clerical errors.",
   "It would repeal about 46 pages of outdated provisions and update language in some laws.",
   "The amendments aim to make the statute book more consistent and easier to read and use."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Corrects technical drafting and clerical errors in Acts.",
   "Repeals spent and obsolete provisions and Acts.",
   "Modernises language and makes other technical amendments in certain legislation."
  ],
  "affected": "The Commonwealth statute book and those who read and administer it.",
